WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.157
The diagnosis dashboard is a good materialized view example.

00:00:04.157 --> 00:00:06.567
Its grain and measures are stable.

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:08.962
The summary may be read frequently.

00:00:08.962 --> 00:00:12.852
And leadership can tolerate a documented refresh interval.

00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:19.625
The materialized view becomes a small data interface with both a schema contract and a freshness contract.
